      "text": "COST: ADDED DEPENDENCY BURDEN\n\n(DESIRABLE \u00b7 what the option adds\nBEYOND what the project already\nneeds, weighed against the share\nof value it buys \u2014 an ecosystem-\nnormal install is not a burden; a\nwhole new runtime bought for a\nfraction of the value is \u00b7 weight\n3)",
