      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "gen": "kerd"
      },
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "OpenFastTrace \u00b7 Installable at all \u00b7 install a system JVM; Java 17 is a common machine-\nlevel dependency \u00b7 temporary \u00b7 low \u2014 no JVM exists on this machine, and a consuming\nproject cannot be assumed to have one \u00b7 the first consuming project confirmed to carry a\nJVM already",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "OpenFastTrace \u00b7 Installable at all \u00b7 install a system JVM; Java 17 is a common machine-\nlevel dependency \u00b7 temporary \u00b7 low \u2014 no JVM exists on this machine, and a consuming\nproject cannot be assumed to have one \u00b7 the first consuming project confirmed to carry a\nJVM already",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t1451",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 2441,
      "width": 594.0,
      "height": 60.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0451",
      "seed": 20157,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 38863,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785400000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "gen": "kerd"
      },
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "OpenFastTrace \u00b7 The producer's ID format \u00b7 keep `<CODE>-<NNN>` in the register we own and\ncarry OFT's `artifacttype~name~revision` as a second, derived ID for tracing only \u00b7\npermanent \u00b7 low \u2014 two ID namespaces is exactly the confusion the register exists to remove\n\u00b7 \u2014",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "OpenFastTrace \u00b7 The producer's ID format \u00b7 keep `<CODE>-<NNN>` in the register we own and\ncarry OFT's `artifacttype~name~revision` as a second, derived ID for tracing only \u00b7\npermanent \u00b7 low \u2014 two ID namespaces is exactly the confusion the register exists to remove\n\u00b7 \u2014",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t1452",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 2513,
      "width": 587.4000000000001,
      "height": 60.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0452",
      "seed": 20164,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 38876,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785400000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "gen": "kerd"
      },
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "OpenFastTrace \u00b7 The twenty-category taxonomy \u00b7 put the category in free-form `Tags:`,\nsince artifact types are tracing-hierarchy levels rather than a taxonomy, and validate it\nourselves \u00b7 permanent \u00b7 low \u2014 tags are unvalidated free text, so the taxonomy would be\nenforced only by our own checker \u00b7 \u2014",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "OpenFastTrace \u00b7 The twenty-category taxonomy \u00b7 put the category in free-form `Tags:`,\nsince artifact types are tracing-hierarchy levels rather than a taxonomy, and validate it\nourselves \u00b7 permanent \u00b7 low \u2014 tags are unvalidated free text, so the taxonomy would be\nenforced only by our own checker \u00b7 \u2014",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t1453",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 2585,
      "width": 580.8000000000001,
      "height": 45.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0453",
      "seed": 20171,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 38889,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785400000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "gen": "kerd"
      },
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "OpenFastTrace \u00b7 The five-state lifecycle \u00b7 hold the five states in our register and map\nonly the four OFT understands \u00b7 permanent \u00b7 low \u2014 the closed set is the vendor's and has\nno documented extension point \u00b7 \u2014",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "OpenFastTrace \u00b7 The five-state lifecycle \u00b7 hold the five states in our register and map\nonly the four OFT understands \u00b7 permanent \u00b7 low \u2014 the closed set is the vendor's and has\nno documented extension point \u00b7 \u2014",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t1454",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 2642,
      "width": 587.4000000000001,
      "height": 45.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
