      "roundness": null,
      "text": "Reqflow \u00b7 Refusal from outside the model \u00b7 run our own checker; reqflow cannot run on\nmacOS at all \u00b7 permanent \u00b7 low \u2014 the refusal would come from the part we wrote, not from\nthe option being evaluated \u00b7 \u2014",
